-- riskchange EXPERT DEEP SEED: Risk, Change & Learning, advanced tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: REVIEW AND LEARNING: CLOSURE, INDEPENDENCE AND PROOF OF
-- USE. The comment disposition loop; the two blocking severities and a review
-- that cannot close; a lesson's three parts and the author who may not
-- validate it (AS15 Q10); the reuse record that counts rather than claims;
-- embedding as earned; lesson review dates; the held items and the owner
-- decisions; and one loop from a lesson into a risk and a change.
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. A lesson is learned when an application
-- proves it changed something, and a rejection is a real record that applies
-- nothing. A review closes when nothing blocking is unresolved, and Responded
-- and Rejected are both unresolved.
--
-- SEGREGATION OF DUTIES IN PEER REVIEW (ASC-0, RECON RC-4a): the author never
-- reviews the work and never takes a reviewer's move. The summary skips comments
-- on finished reviews (RC-4b). ETIM grades one review's own log.
--
-- FRAMED HISTORY: digest SECTION 20 is the only history and Expert m05 l03
-- owns it.
-- ============================================================================

